`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.a,{href:"/docs/asset-selection-feedback/#6-mechanism-blindness-and-regressive-scene-edits",children:"Mechanism blindness and regressive scene edits"})," distinguish sampled visual plausibility from requested solver behavior, and final revisions from best independently accepted revisions. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"/docs/studio-production-case-studies/#dead-cells-generation-must-preserve-the-authored-experience",children:"Dead Cells authored constraints"})," and ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"/docs/studio-production-case-studies/#far-cry-5-stale-previews-and-excessive-automation-can-invalidate-feedback",children:"Far Cry 5 stale-preview tradeoffs"})," provide historical developer evidence for design intent, dependency freshness and gameplay-constrained art direction. The linked notes preserve paper/artifact discrepancies, historical scope and unexecuted transfer hypotheses."]}),`
